SUMMARY:Summerlicious at Yorkville's STK Steakhouse (Bay Station)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\n**On Saturday\, July 18th\, join us for an
 other Summerlicious at STK Steakhouse and Cocktail lounge\, for a steak\, 
 seafood and the ultimate VIBE dining experience.** STK Toronto artfully bl
 ends the modern steakhouse and a chic lounge into one\, offering a dynamic
  fine dining experience with the superior quality of a traditional steakho
 use\, world-class service and the perfect ambiance. STK was recently renov
 ated last November\, and is an international restaurant with locations acr
 oss the US\, Europe\, the Middle East and Mexico. Join me tonight for a lo
 vely fine dining experience\n\n**MENU**\n***APPETIZER (choice)***\nBURRATA
  - marinated heirloom tomatoes\, olive tapenade\, croutons (V)\n\nTUNA TAR
 TARE - hass avocado\, taro chips\, soy-honey emulsion\n\nLIL' BRGS - wagyu
  beef\, special sauce\, pickle\, tomato\, sesame seed bun\n\n***ENTREE (ch
 oice)***\nCALI CUT NY 7oz -confit fingerling potatoes\,\nparmesan gremolat
 a\, chimichurri sauce\n\nMAPLE RUBBED SALMON - pickled cherry\, tomatoes\,
  piquillo broccolini\, olive dressing (G)\n\nWILD MUSHROOM RISOTTO - pecor
 ino\, braised mushrooms\, baby spinach\, shaved black truffle (V)\n\nSHRIM
 P SCAMPI - sauteed shrimp \, linguine\, tomato\, garlic white wine sauce\n
 \n***DESSERT (choice\, all V)***\nBAKED APPLE CRUMBLE - salted caramel ice
  cream\n\nCHEESECAKE - raspberry couli\, berries\n\nCHOCOLATE CAKE - choco
 late ganache sauce (G)\n\n**COST**\nSummerlicious Dinner: $75 + tax + grat
 uity\nOrganizer Meetup fee: $5\n\n**SIGNING-UP**\n\n* RSVP Yes. Everyone g
 oes on the waitlist until they have reserved their seat.\n* To reserve you
 r seat at the table\, an etransfer of $25 (includes $5 meetup fee) is requ
 ired. Attendees will be etransferred back $20 the day after the event. The
 re are no refunds for any reason.\n* Once you are on the waitlist\, I will
  message you my email for the etransfer.\n* Once the transfer is complete\
 , I will move you to attending.\n* A reminder will be sent the night befor
 e with my cell and all meetup details. Make sure you set up your communica
 tion settings to receive.\n\nRSVPs close Wednesday July 15th. Cancellation
 s will result in a No Show and impact future attendance.\n\n**MEETUP TIME*
 *\n**Meet me at: 7pm inside the front doors of STK at 153 Yorkville Ave.**
  Please wait for me to arrive\, and do not sit on your own prior\, so we c
 an get the table requested.\n\nLength: 2 hours\n\nEnjoy and please post yo
 ur Comments in the event after.
