SUMMARY:The Odyssey Action Fantasy in AVX + Dinner (Eglinton Stn.)
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\n**Note**: **AVX show time will be confirme
 d once Cineplex updates their movie times for that week\, latest the Wedne
 sday before.**\n\nOn **Friday July 24th\,** let's see **The Odyssey\, fore
 casted as the number 1 movie for Summer 2026.** ***The Odyssey*** is an up
 coming [epic](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Epic_film "Epic film") [fantas
 y action film](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fantasy_action_film "Fantasy 
 action film") written and directed by [Christopher Nolan](https://en.wikip
 edia.org/wiki/Christopher_Nolan "Christopher Nolan"). An adaptation of [Ho
 mer](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Homer "Homer")'s [ancient Greek](https:
 //en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ancient_Greek "Ancient Greek") epic the *[Odyssey]
 (https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Odyssey "Odyssey")*\, the film stars [Matt 
 Damon](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Matt_Damon "Matt Damon") as [Odysseus
 ](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Odysseus "Odysseus")\, the Greek king of [
 Ithaca](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Homer%27s_Ithaca "Homer's Ithaca")\,
  and chronicles his long and perilous journey home after the [Trojan War](
 https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trojan_War "Trojan War") as he attempts to r
 eunite with his wife\, [Penelope](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Penelope "
 Penelope")\, portrayed by [Anne Hathaway](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/An
 ne_Hathaway "Anne Hathaway"). The [ensemble cast](https://en.wikipedia.org
 /wiki/Ensemble_cast "Ensemble cast") includes [Tom Holland](https://en.wik
 ipedia.org/wiki/Tom_Holland "Tom Holland")\, [Robert Pattinson](https://en
 .wikipedia.org/wiki/Robert_Pattinson "Robert Pattinson")\, [Lupita Nyong'o
 ](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lupita_Nyong%27o "Lupita Nyong'o")\, [Zend
 aya](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Zendaya "Zendaya")\, and [Charlize Ther
 on](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Charlize_Theron "Charlize Theron"). This
  show must be seen in a big format with great sound\, hence we are seeing 
 in AVX. **My seat is TBD. Purchase your tickets for The Odyssey on Friday 
 July 24th at TBC time AVX show at Yonge Eglinton Station.**\n\n**COST**\nA
 dult $23.25/ Senior $18.50/ CineClub $11.00 + tzxes\n\n**SIGNING UP**\n\n*
  **Simply RSVP Yes confirming Yes/No to food/drinks after**\n* **[Purchase
 ](https://www.cineplex.com/search?q=odyssey)** **your own ticket by select
 ing Get Tickets\, Friday July 24th\, The Odyssey\, Yonge Eglinton Station\
 , AVX Show at time TBC**\n* You can also meet the group at the meetup time
  with your ticket in hand\n* RSVPs close the day prior\n\n**MEETUP TIME**\
 n**Meet me at: time TBC in front of AVX Auditorium TBC inside Cineplex Yon
 ge Eglinton Station at 2300 Yonge St**\n\n**Show starts**: TBC\n\nLength: 
 2 hours 52 minutes\n\nAfter: meet me outside AVX Auditorium TBC to head ou
 t for food/drinks nearby\n\nEnjoy and please post your comments in the eve
 nt after.
