SUMMARY:Unionville Day: Nature walk + Art + Shopping  + Dinner + Markham J
 azz Festival
DESCRIPTION:Experience Toronto\nOn **Saturday August 22nd**\, **join us fo
 r a Day in Unionville and be part of the Markham Jazz Festival. The day wi
 ll feature: an Art Gallery Tour\, Nature Scenic Walk\, Shopping/Sightseein
 g on Main Street\, Dinner\, then concerts on the Millennium Bandstand Stag
 e. The final concert will have a mix of musical genres to get you dancing.
  Then\, relax on your drive back home.**\n\n**ITINERARY**\n**2:50pm: Meet 
 outside the [Frederick Horsman Varley Art Gallery](http://www.markham.ca/M
 arkham/Attractions/Gallery/) (Varley is a Group of Seven Member)**\n**3:00
 p: Guided tour of the Varley Art Gallery**\n**3:30p: A scenic walk through
  Too Good Pond Park**\n**4:00 - 5:15pm: Sight-seeing/ shopping (Main stree
 t is a short block)**\n**5:15pm: Dinner**\n**6:45pm: Head over to Millenni
 um Bandstage for final 2 concerts**\n\n**Note**: **you will need to arrang
 e your own transportation to and from\, and confirm if you will be joining
  for dinner\, as reservations are required. In addition\, all out of town 
 events require your cell and email.**\n\n**TRANSPORTATION**:\n\n* Arrange 
 for your own transportation. Feel free to post in the Comments if you want
 /need to carpool.\n* **Carpool attendees MUST have a picture and arrange a
  PUBLIC pick-up/ drop off spot for the security of members**. Any risks as
 sociated with carpooling are borne by the member\, and Experience Toronto 
 cannot be held liable under any circumstances.\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\
 -\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\n**COST**\nMeetup organizer
  fee: $10\n\n\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\
 \-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-\\-
 \\-\\-\\-\n**SIGNING-UP**\n\n* **RSVP Yes and answer the question about Di
 nner\, include your email and cell\, and the system will add you to the wa
 itlist.**\n* **Your email and cell are required for out of town events - f
 or the reminder email and for emergencies the day off**\n* A reminder will
  be sent the day prior to your email with my cell and details for the day.
 \n\nRSVPs close 3 days prior and cancellations after may result in a No Sh
 ow and impact future attendance.\n\n**MEETUP TIME**\n**1:30p**: **Leave To
 ronto**\n**2:50p: Meet outside the [Frederick Horsman Varley Art Gallery](
 http://www.markham.ca/Markham/Attractions/Gallery/) at 216 Main St. in Uni
 onville (Varley is a Group of Seven Member)**\n**3:00p: Guided tour of the
  Varley Art Gallery**\n**3:35p: A scenic walk through Too Good Pond Park**
 \n**4:00p: Sight-seeing/ shopping**\n**5:15p: Dinner**\n**6:45p: Head over
  to Millennium Bandstage for final 2 concerts**\n**7:00p: Ranee Lee Concer
 t** (Ranee Lee is a multi-talented Montreal artist with 13 albums\, a Juno
  Award\, has starred in a Billie Holiday musical\, and toured internationa
 lly)\n**8:45p:** **U. N. Jefferson Concert** (U.N. Jefferson is an origina
 l Motown / Soul band from Toronto)\n9:30 - 10p: Head back to Toronto\n\nEn
 joy and please post your comments in the event after.30
